description=One UI version spoofer with a blue theme. Forces Galaxy Store to serve app updates by spoofing One UI / Android build props at boot. Supports One UI 6.0 and above. Compatible with Magisk, KernelSU, KernelSU Next, SukiSU and APatch. Toggle ON/OFF, change target versions, and fully revert to your stock props anytime from the module WebUI, Action button, or terminal menu.
